かせいたします。\nどうぞよろしくお願いいたします！", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@cosmic_sasami/works/142", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c502f2a9/uploads/origins/2c81e64f-5818-46d9-b445-bfec2f7a770d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d7b3d300cff73ccec3e68e73f433ad85", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 477681, "client_id": 970135, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 177, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@cosmic_sasami/works/141", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 477681, "client_id": 2580293, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e09ce535/uploads/origins/1d4e2514-2b13-4f90-8c21-fa675f3b33b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ee83797576b3d1b1ed742125ddeac01f", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e09ce535/uploads/origins/1d4e2514-2b13-4f90-8c21-fa675f3b33b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dcafd4f6e5e6da1361185691fcbfc597", "src_set": ""}, "body": "うちの子のイラストをお願いしてもいいでしょうか？\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1801VytiuKp23QQcASVgSODs13Kli_TfU?usp=sharing\n\nできればあの「サメ私服　メガネなし」の感じでいいと思いますけど、他の描きたい衣装があったら何でもOKです～\n\n色々かわいいサメのぬいぐるみがある感じの構図をお願いしたいです！\nゴロゴロしている感じとか、それともたくさんのを持ってる感じとか（例えば　こういう感じとか　https://twitter.com/tokutaro/status/1083444974971105280　）\n具体的にお任せします！\n\nよろしくお願いします！", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {